Hi Janet,

I just realized yesterday that a silly typo in getSeq's man page
prevented the new version of BSgenome (1.18.2) to build, hence the
extra delay. Sorry for that. I'm glad you were finally able to update
today.

Thanks again for your feedback. I'll add the option to disable or
enable the grep feature. I'll start by making it enabled by default,
just for the sake of backward compatibility. The motivation for this
feature is to make things as convenient as possible when working
interactively so having to remember to specify 'grep=TRUE' every time
one calls getSeq() interactively would kind of defeat this. But of
course this can be changed later if more people object.

Cheers,
H.


